      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Advanced Solutions for Hydraulic Power: Variable Displacement Vane Pumps 
    &lt;div id=&#34;advanced-solutions-for-hydraulic-power-variable-displacement-vane-pumps&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
